com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/chorus/uploads/chorus_asset/file/25670862/Robotaxi_89.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=640 640w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/chorus/uploads/chorus_asset/file/25670862/Robotaxi_89.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=750 750w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/chorus/uploads/chorus_asset/file/25670862/Robotaxi_89.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=828 828w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/chorus/uploads/chorus_asset/file/25670862/Robotaxi_89.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=1080 1080w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/chorus/uploads/chorus_asset/file/25670862/Robotaxi_89.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=1200 1200w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/chorus/uploads/chorus_asset/file/25670862/Robotaxi_89.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=1440 1440w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/chorus/uploads/chorus_asset/file/25670862/Robotaxi_89.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=1920 1920w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/chorus/uploads/chorus_asset/file/25670862/Robotaxi_89.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=2048 2048w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/chorus/uploads/chorus_asset/file/25670862/Robotaxi_89.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=2400 2400w" src="https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/chorus/uploads/chorus_asset/file/25670862/Robotaxi_89.png?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=2400"/></div><div class="up4voos"><div class="up4voo6"><div><div><div class=""></div><div><div class="_19wv7tc9 _1d4s5vd8 _1d4s5vd0"><a class="_7uluu50 _7uluu54 _7uluu55" href="/transportation/992014/tesla-cybercab-hands-on-test-robotaxi-austin">I spent an hour riding inside Tesla’s steering-wheel-free Cybercab</a></div></div><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup _1d4s5vdm _1d4s5vdc _1d4s5vdd">﻿Issues with the butterfly doors and bizarre drop-off locations cloud what is an otherwise impressive, future-forward experience. </p><div class="jelpeph jelpepd jelpep0"><span><span class="_1g89o322 _1g89o321 _19wv7tc5"><span><span>Mack DeGeurin</span></span></span></span><span class="duet--article--timestamp g4xafw2 g4xafw0 _19wv7tc5 _1044qizs"><time dateTime="2026-09-09T14:41:07+00:00">Sep 9</time></span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="duet--content-cards--content-card duet--content-cards--quick-post rj2ep84 rj2ep89" role="article"><a aria-label="We flew the banned drone with snap-on propeller wings." class="rj2ep88" href="/tech/991569/we-flew-the-banned-drone-with-snap-on-propeller-wings"></a><div class="rj2ep81"><div class="rj2ep87"><div class="_1jiz7rn0 _1jiz7rn1"><div class="_1jiz7rn7"><img alt="Sean Hollister" data-chromatic="ignore" loading="lazy" width="34" height="34" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="_4aoxp34" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/01/Sean_BLURPLE.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=48 1x, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/01/Sean_BLURPLE.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=96 2x" src="https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/01/Sean_BLURPLE.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=96"/></div><div class="_1jiz7rn2 _1jiz7rn3"><span class="_1jiz7rn6">Sean Hollister</span><span class="duet--article--timestamp g4xafw2 g4xafw0 _19wv7tc5 _1jiz7rna"><time dateTime="2026-09-08T17:58:23+00:00">Sep 8</time></span></div></div><div class="_4ine551 _4ine550"><div class="_4ine554">We flew the banned drone with snap-on propeller wings.</div><div class="_1y5ugvbf _1y5ugvb0"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1044qizi _18mzr4b1 _18mzr4b0 _19wv7tc1">Dom says it’s quick and easy to snap a propeller backback onto the HoverAir Versa, and then… it can fly! Shame that HoverAir isn’t transparently telling backers that <a href="/tech/983500/hoverair-versa-halted-us-fcc-drone-ban-indiegogo">this camera has been banned in the US</a>, and shame on the Trump administration for creating the <a href="/report/969725/fcc-drone-ban-odyssey-robot-galiview-etak-randolph-howard-eason">dumb drone ban</a> to begin with.</p></div></div><div class="_1p001ee0"><div class="_1y5ugvb1"><div class="ejz0tzd"></div></div></div></div><div class="dq5wa40"><span class="dq5wa41"></span><span class="_1044qizr"></span><span class="dq5wa42"><div class="_1jiz7rnb dq5wa43"><button aria-label="Copy link"><svg class="_1jiz7rnd" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 40 40" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Link</title><path d="M16.9691 32.9499C14.2358 35.6832 9.78321 35.6832 7.04996 32.9499C4.31671 30.2166 4.31665 25.764 7.04996 23.0307L12.5606 17.52C15.294 14.7867 19.7465 14.7867 22.4798 17.52C22.704 17.7383 22.8315 18.037 22.8337 18.3499C22.8359 18.6628 22.7125 18.9634 22.4912 19.1846C22.2702 19.4059 21.9693 19.5293 21.6568 19.5271C21.3439 19.5249 21.0449 19.3975 20.8266 19.1732C18.9805 17.3271 16.0599 17.3271 14.2137 19.1732L8.70306 24.6839C6.85694 26.53 6.85694 29.4507 8.70306 31.2968C10.5492 33.1429 13.4698 33.1426 15.3159 31.2968L20.551 26.0614V26.0617C20.7693 25.8375 21.0683 25.71 21.3811 25.7078C21.694 25.7056 21.9946 25.829 22.2159 26.0503C22.4368 26.2716 22.5602 26.5722 22.5581 26.885C22.5559 27.1979 22.4284 27.4966 22.2042 27.7149L16.9691 32.9499ZM27.4394 22.4796C24.706 25.2129 20.2535 25.2129 17.5202 22.4796V22.4799C17.296 22.2616 17.1685 21.9629 17.1663 21.65C17.1644 21.3372 17.2875 21.0366 17.5088 20.8153C17.7301 20.5941 18.0307 20.4707 18.3435 20.4728C18.6564 2