8w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/268725_Fairphone_6_Plus_review_AJohnson_0001.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0.012500000000003%2C0%2C99.975%2C100&amp;w=2400 2400w" src="https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/268725_Fairphone_6_Plus_review_AJohnson_0001.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0.012500000000003%2C0%2C99.975%2C100&amp;w=2400"/><div class="_1j7g5t30 xhcq400"><p class="_1j7g5t31 xhcq401">8</p><p class="_1j7g5t32 xhcq402">Verge Score</p></div></div><div class="up4voos"><div class="up4voo6"><div><div><div class=""></div><div><div class="_19wv7tc9 _1d4s5vd8 _1d4s5vd0"><a class="_7uluu50 _7uluu54 _7uluu55" href="/tech/990436/fairphone-6-plus-review">The Fairphone 6 Plus is the midrange phone we desperately needed</a></div></div><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup _1d4s5vdm _1d4s5vdc _1d4s5vdd">﻿Fairphone’s proper US debut feels like a triumph in the middle of RAMageddon.</p><div class="jelpeph jelpepd jelpep0"><span><span class="_1g89o322 _1g89o321 _19wv7tc5"><span><span>Allison Johnson</span></span></span></span><span class="duet--article--timestamp g4xafw2 g4xafw0 _19wv7tc5 _1044qizs"><time dateTime="2026-09-06T13:00:00+00:00">Sep 6</time></span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="duet--content-cards--content-card duet--content-cards--quick-post rj2ep84 rj2ep89" role="article"><a aria-label="This is Project Aeroblade." class="rj2ep88" href="/tech/990624/lenovo-project-aeroblade-fans"></a><div class="rj2ep81"><div class="rj2ep87"><div class="_1jiz7rn0 _1jiz7rn1"><div class="_1jiz7rn7"><img alt="Sean Hollister" data-chromatic="ignore" loading="lazy" width="34" height="34" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="_4aoxp34" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/01/Sean_BLURPLE.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=48 1x, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/01/Sean_BLURPLE.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=96 2x" src="https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/01/Sean_BLURPLE.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=96"/></div><div class="_1jiz7rn2 _1jiz7rn3"><span class="_1jiz7rn6">Sean Hollister</span><span class="duet--article--timestamp g4xafw2 g4xafw0 _19wv7tc5 _1jiz7rna"><time dateTime="2026-09-05T13:05:00+00:00">Sep 5</time></span></div></div><div class="_4ine551 _4ine550"><div class="_4ine554">This is Project Aeroblade.</div><div class="_1y5ugvbf _1y5ugvb0"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1044qizi _18mzr4b1 _18mzr4b0 _19wv7tc1"><a href="/2023/11/27/23975368/frore-airjet-apple-macbook-air-fanless-mems">Remember Frore</a> and its fan-replacing <a href="/2023/5/23/23733592/frore-airjet-zotac-mini-desktop-pc-zbox-pi430aj-price">AirJet cooling tech</a>? Sure looks like Lenovo is <a href="/tech/988882/lenovo-project-aeroblade-concept-frore-airjet-silent-cooling">taking it seriously</a>!</p></div></div><div class="_1p001ee0"><div class="_1y5ugvb1"><div class="ejz0tzd"></div></div></div></div><div class="dq5wa40"><span class="dq5wa41"></span><span class="_1044qizr"></span><span class="dq5wa42"><div class="_1jiz7rnb dq5wa43"><button aria-label="Copy link"><svg class="_1jiz7rnd" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 40 40" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Link</title><path d="M16.9691 32.9499C14.2358 35.6832 9.78321 35.6832 7.04996 32.9499C4.31671 30.2166 4.31665 25.764 7.04996 23.0307L12.5606 17.52C15.294 14.7867 19.7465 14.7867 22.4798 17.52C22.704 17.7383 22.8315 18.037 22.8337 18.3499C22.8359 18.6628 22.7125 18.9634 22.4912 19.1846C22.2702 19.4059 21.9693 19.5293 21.6568 19.5271C21.3439 19.5249 21.0449 19.3975 20.8266 19.1732C18.9805 17.3271 16.0599 17.3271 14.2137 19.1732L8.70306 24.6839C6.85694 26.53 6.85694 29.4507 8.70306 31.2968C10.5492 33.1429 13.4698 33.1426 15.3159 31.2968L20.